                    // Apply/generate the Givens rotations, rotating H's column j and rhs g. False
                    // means H[j,j] and the Arnoldi subdiagonal are both exactly zero -- no usable
                    // pivot (would divide by zero in HessenbergBackSolve). Exclude column j.
